# Apple ld(1) "exported_symbols_list" file for librescrs-pkcs11.dylib.
#
# Restricts the exported symbol set of the PKCS#11 module to the standard
# PKCS#11 v2.40 / v3.0 C interface only. Without this allowlist the
# statically linked OpenSSL crypto library and the LibreSCRS internal
# implementation namespaces would all leak as dylib exports — a layering
# / supply-chain smell that the API-policy explicitly forbids.
#
# Wildcard rules (Apple ld supports `*` and `?`):
#   _C_*            — all PKCS#11 standard entry points (C_Initialize,
#                     C_GetInfo, C_GetSlotList, …, C_DigestUpdate, …,
#                     C_GetFunctionList — the alternate entry name the
#                     spec defines for consumers that prefer not to dlsym
#                     every individual C_* function).
#
# Anything else (OpenSSL ASN1_*, LibreSCRS::*, libresign::*,
# LibreSCRS::SmartCard::Internal::*) is hidden from the dynamic export
# table.
_C_*
